'@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 结束充电与自动扣费时序图
actor 用户 as U
participant 前端 as FE
participant 充电控制器 as Ctrl
participant 计费服务 as Bill
participant 支付服务 as Pay
database 数据库 as DB

U -> FE: 点击"结束充电"
FE -> Ctrl: POST /charges/stop {recordId}
Ctrl -> DB: SELECT charge_record, charger, user FROM ...
DB --> Ctrl: 充电记录、桩信息、用户余额

Ctrl -> Bill: 计算充电量与费用
Bill --> Ctrl: energyKwh=15.0, fee=22.50

Ctrl -> Pay: 校验余额 >= 22.50 元
Pay -> DB: SELECT balance FROM users WHERE id = ?
DB --> Pay: 余额充足

alt 余额充足
  group 事务开始
    Ctrl -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET end_time=now(), energy_kwh=15.0, fee=22.50, status='completed'
    DB --> Ctrl: 更新成功

    Ctrl -> Pay: 执行扣费 22.50 元
    Pay -> DB: UPDATE users SET balance = balance - 22.50 WHERE id = ? AND balance >= 22.50
    DB --> Pay: 扣费成功

    Pay -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (user_id, charge_record_id, amount, status='success')
    DB --> Pay: 记录成功

    Ctrl -> DB: UPDATE chargers SET status = 'idle' WHERE id = ?
    DB --> Ctrl: 桩已释放

    Ctrl -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs ... action='stop_charge'
  end
  Ctrl --> FE: 充电结束 {fee=22.50, energy=15.0}
  FE --> U: 显示结算信息
else 余额不足
  group 事务开始
    Ctrl -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET status = 'arrears'
    DB --> Ctrl: 标记欠费

    Ctrl -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs ... action='charge_arrears'
  end
  Ctrl --> FE: 返回"欠费"提示（桩状态保持"使用中"）
  FE --> U: 显示"余额不足，已标记欠费"
end

Ctrl --> FE: 充电结束 {fee=22.50, energy=15.0}
FE --> U: 显示结算信息
@enduml